            <h2>Train Duration, Distance, and Travel Time Overview</h2>

            <p>Traveling from Portland to Seattle covers roughly 145 miles (233 km) across the Pacific Northwest, linking two of the region's most vibrant cities. Although this isn't a high-speed rail corridor like in Europe, Amtrak's Cascades and Coast Starlight trains offer a steady and pleasant pace, often making the trip more enjoyable than a long drive.</p>

